        "id": 1947461
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-12T01:42:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These are the cases that verifie that packet is not sent if `unregisterQuicConnectionClosePayload` is called before the network is blocked.\n\n\u003e Is it the case that close packets are not sent if the network is blocked?\n\nL4342 ~ L4347 ensures that packet is sent when the network is blocked.",
      "parentUuid": "6f12674e_6d68728f",
